233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 77 0 R/T(It is important to practise the relaxations in pregnancy and listen to the audio. They can also be very calming in early labour. But in established labour the surges will be too close together to have time to do a relaxation in between, although it can still be helpful to have the audio playing in the background. )/E(It is important to practise the relaxations in pregnancy and listen to the audio. They can also be very calming in early labour. But in established labour the surges will be too close together to have time to do a relaxation in between, although it can still be helpful to have the audio playing in the background. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[1]>>
